- `opencode_idle.py`: During a live OpenCode smoke, switch models and verify
  that `session.model` follows the active model before summarize; if it lags,
  source the compaction model from the newest user event's `info.model` (G2 O3).
- `projections/*`: `ResolvedLaunchSpec.claude_runtime` (formerly `claude_plugin_dirs`) is Claude-only but
  forced a `_DELEGATED_FIELDS` edit in six non-Claude projections, following the
  `disallowed_tools` / `pi_extension_entrypoints` / `opencode_version`
  precedent. That is the 10-file-edit smell from `AGENTS.md`; the next
  harness-specific spec field should go on a per-harness spec extension rather
